# Accounting Firm – Website Testing

## Project Overview

**Type:** One-time Testing Assignment  
**Testing Approach:** Manual & Functional Website Testing  
**Context:** Tunisian Accounting Firm

I was contacted to perform a one-time testing assignment on an accounting firm's website.

The objective was to review the website, identify issues and inconsistencies, and document findings to highlight areas requiring correction or improvement.

## Testing Activities

The assignment included:

- Reviewing website pages and functionalities.
- Identifying website issues and inconsistencies.
- Documenting observations and potential improvements.
- Capturing screenshots as supporting evidence.
- Preparing an Excel report summarizing the findings.

## Issues & Findings

The identified issues and observations are documented in the accompanying testing report.

The report includes descriptions of the findings and supporting screenshots.

## Deliverables

- Website testing and issue identification.
- Excel report documenting the findings.
- Screenshots illustrating the identified issues.

## Skills Demonstrated

- Manual Website Testing
- Functional Testing
- Issue Identification
- Bug Reporting
- Test Documentation
- Screenshot Evidence Collection

---

*This project represents a one-time practical website testing assignment and demonstrates my approach to identifying and documenting website issues.*
